config:
  layout: elk
---
stateDiagram
    direction TB
    [*] --> BOOT_GRACE
    
    BOOT_GRACE --> SCANNING : 5s elapsed (mute events)
    
    SCANNING --> SCANNING : actualRead == lastRead (poll 100ms)
    SCANNING --> DEBOUNCE : actualRead != lastRead
    
    DEBOUNCE --> APPEARED : Change confirmed (tag present)
    DEBOUNCE --> DISAPPEARED : Change confirmed (tag absent)
    DEBOUNCE --> SCANNING : Change was false alarm
    
    APPEARED --> TAG_EVENT
    DISAPPEARED --> TAG_EVENT
    TAG_EVENT --> SCANNING : Event processed
    
    note right of BOOT_GRACE
        Mutes tag_event_fsm for 5s
        Prevents false APPEARED on reboot
    end note
    
    note right of DEBOUNCE
        Universal debouncer:
        - Confirms actualRead != lastRead is real
        - Same logic for both directions
        - 200ms confirmation period
    end note
    
    note right of SCANNING
        Continuous polling:
        - Check every 100ms
        - Compare actualRead vs lastRead
    end note